the '80s and '90s so good?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.160
- I know. Well.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.110
Yes! I know. (clapping)
(Drew laughing)

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.610
No sorry.
(audience applauding)

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.380
Yeah. Well we met before.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.330
So we all went. Our friend, Sam Rockwell.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.190
- Who won an academy award.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.081
And he was the lead in Charlie's Angels.

00:09:04.081 --> 00:09:05.490
