the lead in this movie.

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.750
And we always knew that
he was the most talented

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.450
most dynamic actor. And finally
he won his Academy Award.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.370
- Yeah, so deserved. Long deserved.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.010
But we had just done Galaxy
Quest and we had done a play.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.660
So, Sam and I, became really good friends.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:28.747
And one night, he said,

00:09:28.747 --> 00:09:31.020
"Hey, you wanna go out? I'm
gonna meet some friends.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.447
You gotta meet drew. You gotta meet drew."

00:09:34.869 --> 00:09:37.020
And I said, "Oh yeah,
you know, I'd love to!"

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:40.245
I was at 21. I was just out
to LA for the first time.

00:09:40.245 --> 00:09:41.820
- Just getting out of your diapers.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.970
- Getting out of the diapers.
I was just completing puberty.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:45.960
Almost completing puberty.
(Drew laughing)

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:46.793
And I thought-

00:09:46.793 --> 00:09:48.824
- You know what? You were
a late bloomer though.

00:09:48.824 --> 00:09:50.065
- I was.
- That was sort of...

00:09:50.065 --> 00:09:51.030
You know
(Justin laughing)

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:51.870
- I was a late bloomer.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.940
Yes. Let's talk about that.
(Drew and audience laughing)

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.260
Let's unpack that.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.310
Yeah. Thank you.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:10:00.810
- And yet, you still look, really young.

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.070
- Oh, you-

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:02.903
- I mean that compliment- (laughing)

00:10:02.903 --> 00:10:04.265
- Okay! Okay.

00:10:04.265 --> 00:10:07.110
- I mean that complimentary. You do.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:08.160
In your intro,
- Oh.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.770
