(Drew and audience laughing)

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.000
Yeah. I'm like, it's gonna get...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.040
As you age with a young
face, it's not a great...

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:17.940
But you look...

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:19.680
So, we were all talking backstage,

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.474
- You look so pretty. So good.
- Really?!

00:10:21.474 --> 00:10:22.822
- So pretty.
- Oh my God, thank you.

00:10:22.822 --> 00:10:24.720
That means so much to me. You
know what I've done to myself,

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.956
so I'm just hanging on.
- That's amazing. (laughing)

00:10:26.956 --> 00:10:27.789
(audience laughing)

00:10:27.789 --> 00:10:28.883
I know, considering,
- Kind of is.

00:10:28.883 --> 00:10:30.060
- all the hedonism.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.860
- I think it's all gonna turn a corner

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.660
in like a matter of a day.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:34.493
That's what I feel like.

00:10:34.493 --> 00:10:35.326
One day, it's just gonna be like.

00:10:35.326 --> 00:10:36.159
