00:10:36.159 --> 00:10:37.497
(Drew and audience laughing)

00:10:37.497 --> 00:10:38.449
- Ahhh.
- Ahhh. Yeah.

00:10:38.449 --> 00:10:39.840
- I know. It's really true.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.147
- Yeah.

00:10:41.147 --> 00:10:42.480
- It's like bad.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.790
- It's held together, but-

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.293
- Wait, what was your
nickname? What was my nickname?

00:10:46.293 --> 00:10:47.670
Well we gave each other Play...

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:48.750
'Cause we were going
on the Playboy Mansion.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.426
So we gave each other Playboy names.

00:10:50.426 --> 00:10:51.259
