00:11:02.153 --> 00:11:03.060
- Yes.
- Whiskey Vargas!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.530
- Yeah. Great, you got it!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.730
- Yeah! (laughing)

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.080
Oh my God our game nights.

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:07.913
Yes!

00:11:07.913 --> 00:11:09.720
- Oh, God. I was a nutcase.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.673
I used to just drink and be like, Play!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.113
(audience laughing)

00:11:14.113 --> 00:11:15.480
I was that guy. I wasn't-
(audience applauding)

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.487
- It's true. It was wild,

00:11:17.487 --> 00:11:19.950
but I remember playing
with Quentin Tarantino.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.750
- Oh my God! We played with Quentin.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.124
- Yeah. Catch Phrase or?

00:11:24.124 --> 00:11:26.040
- Oh, no.
- It was,

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.450
- Oh, God.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.167
Apples to Apples! Was it Apples to Apples?

00:11:29.167 --> 00:11:30.120
- It could have been Apples to Apples.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.980
It was that... Cranium!
- Cranium! Yes.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.707
